: 25% chance of -3000€ → 25% on unfavorable. So B has a greater portion of probability on unfavorable outcomes. Therefore, B is more right-skewed. The reason prefers the more right-skewed lottery, so it prefers B. The information relevant to the decision reason is thus: A has 20% chance of -4000€, B has 25% chance of -3000€. So B has more probability mass on the unfavorable outcome. Hence, B is more right-skewed. The decision reason can be applied.",
